<title>AUSTRALIA: Cambridge seen exiting offshore mining.</title>
<headline>Cambridge seen exiting offshore mining.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cambridge Gulf Exploration has abandoned its four-year bid to operate an offshore diamond mine and now wants to invest in a resource project which will pay immediate returns, the West Australian newspaper reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Earlier, Cambridge Gulf requested a trading halt pending clarification of the report.</p>
</text>
